  (text "M1 regulator supplies OLED, BME280 and low-voltage logic.\nNo second 3.3 V regulator connected in parallel.\nCH343P already connects to GPIO43/44 on M1.\nBoth M1 power jumpers remain OPEN.\nUSB on M1 alone: ESP/OLED/BME run, RTC main supply absent."
